# Derived artifacts: JSON, plots and compiled simulations, all reproducible from logs/ beside them.
out/

# The repo root ignores *.log to keep build and run output out of history. The files in logs/ are
# measurement data rather than build noise -- they are the evidence behind the battery numbers in
# devkit/DEBUGGING.md and cannot be regenerated without another 40-hour discharge -- so re-include
# them. Without this they are silently skipped by `git add` and the analysis scripts here have
# nothing to read on a fresh clone.
!logs/*.log
